### POST request to create a manual notification
POST http://localhost:8000/api/notifications
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "hospitalId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111",
  "patientId": "123e4567-e89b-12d3-a456-426614174000",
  "channel": "EMAIL",
  "recipientAddress": "john.doe@example.com",
  "recipientName": "John Doe",
  "subject": "Manual notification",
  "body": "This is a simulated notification from MediTrack."
}
